{
  "_about": "Every storage key the app uses (localStorage unless noted). backup = the field name in the backup file (exportData / importData), or null with a reason. signinUndo = saved before the first sign-in choice so Undo is exact (SIGNIN_BACKUP_KEYS). Checked by tests/verify_storage_keys.mjs: a new key fails until it is listed here.",
